# Bookings (M3.4 availability, M3.5 bookings, M3.6 cancellation). See prompt-reference/bookings_module.txt
@baseUrl = {{$dotenv HTTP_BASE_URL}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv HTTP_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv HTTP_PASSWORD}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 1. Cars free for the dates (plus turnaround time)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/availability?from=2026-12-20T09:00&to=2026-12-23T09:00&driveType=self_drive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Quote (same calculation the booking uses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carId": "REPLACE_CAR_ID", "pickupAt": "2026-12-20T09:00", "returnAt": "2026-12-23T09:00", "driveType": "self_drive" }

### 3. Book (held until confirmed - add "confirm": true to confirm straight away)
# @name booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "REPLACE_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "carId": "REPLACE_CAR_ID",
  "pickupAt": "2026-12-20T09:00",
  "returnAt": "2026-12-23T09:00",
  "driveType": "self_drive",
  "source": "phone",
  "discountAmount": 5000,
  "discountReason": "Returning customer"
}

###
@bookingId = {{booking.response.body.$.data.id}}

### 4. List (search by reference, name or phone)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings?status=pending&sortBy=pickupAt&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Detail (with the frozen quote)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Confirm
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. What cancelling now would cost
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Cancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Customer changed plans" }

### 9. History
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Preview a change (nothing saved): extend by a day
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/modifications/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "extend", "returnAt": "2026-12-24T09:00" }

### 11. Apply it (also: change_dates, swap_car with carId + charge + reason, early_return)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/modifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "extend", "returnAt": "2026-12-24T09:00" }

### 12. Drivers free for the booking's time
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/drivers?availableFrom=2026-12-20T09:00&availableTo=2026-12-24T09:00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Add a driver
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Yaw Mensah", "phone": "024 555 0001", "licenceNo": "DL-12345", "licenceClass": "B", "licenceExpiresOn": "2028-06-30", "dailyRateAmount": 15000 }

### 14. Assign a driver to a with-driver booking (null removes)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/driver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "driverId": "REPLACE_DRIVER_ID" }
